  "rationale": "Enabling gencode activates transcript FASTA preprocessing and changes the biotype attribute from gene_biotype to gene_type in CUSTOM_CATADDITIONALFASTA and featureCounts, propagating changes through reference preparation, alignment, quantification and downstream quality control under Nextflow task-cache semantics. The supplied Salmon index remains unchanged because the baseline provides a prebuilt index. This prediction assumes that the annotation contains gene_type on the required feature rows, that inferred strandedness remains unchanged, and that the supplied transcriptome and Salmon index remain compatible; otherwise, SUBREAD_FEATURECOUNTS and CUSTOM_MULTIQCCUSTOMBIOTYPE may be removed or further execution differences may arise."
